            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TINARUTH22"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made this recipe numerous times and it is always a hit. I tend to marinade overnight and then pour it in the strainer to drain the extra fluid. I have gotten creative with ingredients adding apples , pineapple with the juice instead of the sugar radishes or whatever I have.",
            "datePublished": "2015-03-21T04:36:20.683Z"
          },
          {
