              "name": "Elizabeth Monti"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We loved it! I have taken it to many potlucks and it is always a hit. It is quick and easy, as well. I did reduce the sugar to 3/4 cup, but that's my personal taste.",
            "datePublished": "2022-11-04T21:32:30.572Z"
